    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/e780ca0d59eba12f306f6c7d0582817b.avif?t=1750982338\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>DEMO version</strong> of <i>Stellarcraft</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full <i>Early Access</i> version is available on a separate Steam page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3627fa812d1b754de76d21739a141af8.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellarcraft is a sci-fi tower defense game in which you explore different planets, collect resources and complete missions. Build and upgrade defenses to fend off enemy waves and develop your character. Strategic planning and technological upgrades are the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/80a29521d6388e342592b1b05c9ea624.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different planets with unique biomes and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet offers different resources and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your exploration to find strategic positions for your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/f721266c4e07f7f583b2e28e2164e6a4.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources such as minerals, energy and rare metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are crucial for building and upgrading defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain planets have special resources that are needed to produce advanced technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/a353a4d4f163513e3507405418cb48de.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions ranging from defending your base to exploring new territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions offer rewards such as new technologies, resources or special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions can offer additional challenges and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3ccf5c278861dc671727398fcad2ac3a.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different towers and defenses to defend yourself against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tower has unique abilities and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your defenses strategically to maximize efficiency and conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3abf34159b67a165a7d12b6aeb35499a.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your character by using collected resources and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and equipment to increase your effectiveness in missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop different specializations such as combat skills or technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/75764b078a84190692c0490f05102f93.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technologies to unlock more advanced defenses and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades improve the effectiveness and resistance of your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different technologies to develop customized strategies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/e780ca0d59eba12f306f6c7d0582817b.avif?t=1750982338\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>DEMO version</strong> of <i>Stellarcraft</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full <i>Early Access</i> version is available on a separate Steam page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3627fa812d1b754de76d21739a141af8.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stellarcraft is a sci-fi tower defense game in which you explore different planets, collect resources and complete missions. Build and upgrade defenses to fend off enemy waves and develop your character. Strategic planning and technological upgrades are the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/80a29521d6388e342592b1b05c9ea624.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different planets with unique biomes and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each planet offers different resources and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your exploration to find strategic positions for your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/f721266c4e07f7f583b2e28e2164e6a4.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources such as minerals, energy and rare metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are crucial for building and upgrading defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain planets have special resources that are needed to produce advanced technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/a353a4d4f163513e3507405418cb48de.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions ranging from defending your base to exploring new territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions offer rewards such as new technologies, resources or special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side missions can offer additional challenges and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3ccf5c278861dc671727398fcad2ac3a.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build different towers and defenses to defend yourself against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tower has unique abilities and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your defenses strategically to maximize efficiency and conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/3abf34159b67a165a7d12b6aeb35499a.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your character by using collected resources and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new skills and equipment to increase your effectiveness in missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop different specializations such as combat skills or technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872620/extras/75764b078a84190692c0490f05102f93.avif?t=1750982338\" width=614 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technologies to unlock more advanced defenses and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades improve the effectiveness and resistance of your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different technologies to develop customized strategies.</p>",
